      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "找到“幕后黑手”了，发出噪声的是你们这些淘气的小家伙~",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_wink",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "原来只是一些小羽兽而已。这下可以安心睡觉了吧，阿梅？",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "嘉辛塔",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4237_jcinta",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "jxt",
              "animationName": "Salute",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "好丢人......！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_ashamed_angry",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "不是我嘴硬，只是这些小羽兽发出的声音好像真的......和我平时听到的不太一样......",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_ashamed_angry",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "我也听出来了。而且，仔细看，它们是不是都长着四只小爪子？比起“羽兽”，它们好像更像奶奶口中的传说生物欸！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_surprised",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "唔，好像是有四只小爪子？我不太确定——",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_confused",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "哎呀，它们在飞，我看不清呀！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_armscrossed_angry_max",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "tn",
              "animationName": "Interact",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "既然塔妮和阿梅都那么在意，我们就悄悄地再靠近一点看看，小心不要惊吓到它们哦——",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_wink",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
